  "title": "TECMP: Fix macro MIN/MAX comparison with unsigned",
  "description": "tvb_captured_length_remaining is unsigned, as is length2, so\ncalling MAX(0, ...) is a no-op. Since they're both unsigned, and\nthis is inside a test of tvb_captured_length_remaining(...) < length2,\nthere's no reason for the MIN either.\n\nCoverity CID 1677956\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
